  <section class="intro" id="sleep-overview">
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">兒童呼吸系統</span>
      <h2>持續鼻鼾，可能是睡眠窒息症的信號</h2>
      <p>你的小朋友有在睡眠時發出鼻鼾，開口呼吸，或者日間專注力不足嗎？那他可能患上了睡眠窒息症。</p>
      <p>兒童睡眠時有鼻鼾是十分常見的。每一百個兒童之中，就有十至十五個有持續性鼻鼾。不過，每四個有持續性鼻鼾的兒童之中，就有一個患有兒童睡眠窒息症。</p>
      <p>阻塞性睡眠窒息症是指在睡覺期間出現短暫性呼吸停頓，而引致身體缺氧、警醒、難以進入熟睡狀態。</p>
      <p>如有擔心，請盡快諮詢專科醫生。兒童睡眠門診由專科醫生主理，專注處理兒童及青少年的睡眠問題，提供個人化的診斷及治療。</p>
    </div>
    <img src="/assets/img/venco_sleep_sleeping_child_legacy.png" alt="熟睡中的兒童" />
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" id="sleep-causes">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-label">兒童阻塞性睡眠窒息症的成因</span>
      <h2>四類常見成因</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="causes" role="list">
      <div role="listitem"><img src="/assets/img/venco_sleep_throat_legacy.png" alt="" /><strong>扁桃腺體及增殖體肥大</strong></div>
      <div role="listitem"><img src="/assets/img/venco_sleep_fat_boy_legacy.png" alt="" /><strong>肥胖</strong></div>
      <div role="listitem"><img src="/assets/img/venco_sleep_boy_running_nose_legacy.png" alt="" /><strong>鼻敏感</strong></div>
      <div role="listitem"><img src="/assets/img/venco_sleep_boy_head_legacy.png" alt="" /><strong>顱面結構異常</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="two-column" id="sleep-symptoms">
    <article class="info-card day">
      <img class="card-icon" src="/assets/img/venco_sleep_sleepy_girl_legacy.png" alt="" />
      <span class="section-label">日間徵狀</span>
      <ul>
        <li>渴睡</li>
        <li>專注力不足</li>
        <li>過度活躍及行為問題</li>
        <li>早上起床有頭痛</li>
        <li>脾氣暴躁</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article class="info-card night">
      <img class="card-icon" src="/assets/img/venco_sleep_sleeping_boy_legacy.png" alt="" />
      <span class="section-label">晚間徵狀</span>
      <ul>
        <li>鼻鼾聲大</li>
        <li>睡眠間出現短暫呼吸停頓，然後很用力及大聲呼吸</li>
        <li>睡眠時出很多汗</li>
        <li>睡眠時開口呼吸</li>
        <li>脾氣暴躁</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

